OL,3,GNEWSAMurder investigation after human
OL,4,Abones found
OL,5,
OL,6,FA murder investigation is under way
OL,7,Fafter human bones were found at a west
OL,8,FLondon park, the Metropolitan Police
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FThe remains were discovered after
OL,12,Femergency services were called to
OL,13,FBedfont Lakes Country Park in Hounslow
OL,14,Fat about 18:35 BST on Wednesday, 12
OL,15,FAugust.
OL,17,FFollowing a post-mortem examination,
OL,18,Fpolice said the bones belonged to a
OL,19,Fwoman aged between 25 and 45. They said
OL,20,Fit was not clear how long the remains
OL,21,Fhad been there and officers were still
OL,22,Fworking to identify the woman.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,325,320,200,140,0,100
