OL,3,GNEWSAMurder investigation after human
OL,4,Abones found
OL,5,
OL,6,FDet Ch Insp Wayne Jolley, who is
OL,7,Fleading the investigation, said: "We
OL,8,Fare working to establish the full
OL,9,Fcircumstances of what happened while
OL,10,Fkeeping an open mind."
